    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 72 is a wonderfully spacious two-bedroom ground floor apartment, ideally positioned within Blacklion Manor, a mature and well-regarded development in Greystones. Extending to approximately 83 sq.m / 893 sq.ft, this attractive apartment offers bright, well-balanced accommodation with generous room proportions, a practical layout and the added benefit of direct access to a private patio.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the apartment enjoys a lovely sense of space and light, with a particularly impressive open-plan living/dining room forming the heart of the home. With a B BER rating, gas-fired central heating and a thoughtful internal layout, No. 72 is likely to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\n\nUpon entering, a welcoming entrance hall leads to the main reception room, which is a notably generous and inviting space. Enjoying a dual aspect which allows natural light to fill the room, built-in shelving with a cozy gas fireplace creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. Direct access to the patio provides a welcome connection to the outdoors. The kitchen, adjacent to the main living space, is well appointed with floor and eye-level cabinetry, quartz worktops, and a range of integrated appliances. Its position beside the living/dining room makes for a practical and sociable layout, while still allowing the kitchen to remain neatly defined.\n\nThe bedroom accommodation comprises two generous double bedrooms. The principal bedroom is a particularly spacious double with fitted sliding wardrobes and is served by an en-suite shower room. The second bedroom is also a fine size, complete with fitted sliding wardrobes and shelving, offering flexibility for guests, or a home office depending on one's needs. A well-appointed family bathroom completes the internal accommodation.\n\nOutside, the private patio is a real highlight of the property, providing an ideal spot to sit out and enjoy a quiet morning coffee or evening drink. The apartment's ground floor position further enhances its ease of living, making it an especially convenient option for those seeking accessible, low-maintenance accommodation.\n\nThe apartment enjoys a highly convenient position just north of Greystones town centre, with a wide range of everyday amenities close at hand including a supermarket, doctor's surgery, dental practice, local retail offerings and nearby bus routes. The property is also situated across the road from Gaelscoil na gCloch Liath, Greystones Educate Together and Temple Carrig Secondary School. For commuters, the DART, N11, M11 and M50 provide excellent connectivity to the city, while closer to home there is an abundance of sporting amenities for all ages including sailing, rugby, tennis and golf clubs within the village. Marina Village is a pleasant stroll away, while historic Delgany village is also close by and offers a further selection of hospitality options.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this fine home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
