        "Content": "\nEntrace Hall: - 5.91m x 3.45m\nLaminate wood flooring, recessed lighting, alarm panel: access to:\n\nHP: - \nWooden shelving for storage.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.55m x 6.82m\nLaminate wooden flooring, dual aspect room, built-in wooden shelving, gas fireplace, window looking to the front, access to patio.\n\nKitchen - 2.04m x 3.00m\nFloor and eye-level cabinetry, tiled flooring, quartz countertop, along with tiled splashback, stainless steel sink, gas hob, extractor fan, integrated oven and microwave, fridge/freezer, dishwasher and washing machine.\n\nFamily Bathroom: - 2.15m x 1.97m\nTiled flooring and walls, WC, bath and shower, floating wash hand basin, stainless steel heated towel rail, wall mounted mirror, vanity light,\n\nMain Bedroom 1 - 4.45m x 3.70m\nDouble bedroom, fitted wardrobe, served by:\n\nEnsuite Shower Room. - 1.50 x 1.97m\nTiled flooring and walls, floating wash hand basin, step-in shower, stainless steel heated towel rail, WC, wall mounted mirror, vanity light.\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.22m x 4.10m\nDouble bedroom, fitted sliding wardrobe, fitted shelving, window to the front.\n\nPatio - \nDecked outdoor seating area.\n\n"
